      "content": "---\nname: slop-cannon-known-videos\ndescription: >-\n  Use when scanning X for Slop Cannon videos: the known list of Slop Cannon\n  videos posted from late August to Oct 8, 2026, to load as the seen list and to\n  resume from the newest ID.\n---\n# Known Slop Cannon videos on X\n\nNewest origin post ID in this list: 2108308618277785985, captured 2026-10-08 (Pacific time). The newest post ID scanned overall was 2108308618277785985, so use it as since_id when you catch up.\n\nThere are 547 videos here, posted 2026-08-24 to 2026-10-08. Each row is the original post that carries the video; quotes, reposts, and edits were traced back to it. The list covers both the text search and a link search (`url:slop.cc`) back to the start, so posts that only link slop.cc are included.\n\nYou can browse these videos at [jon-slop.grok.me](https://jon-slop.grok.me).\n\n## Reading the table\n- **ID** is the origin post ID.\n- **Creator** is the @handle of the original poster, written without the @.\n- **Origin URL** is not stored. Build it as https://x.com/<creator>/status/<ID>.\n- **Posted** is the date in Pacific time, as MM-DD. Every date is in 2026.\n- **Phase** is C, O, or S:\n  - C is closed beta, before the open beta announcement on 2026-09-04 at 5:19 PM PT.\n  - O is open beta, from that announcement until Sloptoberfest.\n  - S is Sloptoberfest, from 2026-10-05 on.\n- A **?** after the phase means the video is unsure: the post doesn't name Slop Cannon outright. Most of these are videos by the tool's maker, @boneGPT, or posts he quoted.\n\n## How to use\n- Treat every ID below as already seen, and never report one as new.\n- To catch up, run the slop-cannon-scan skill from the since_id above up to now, including its link search, and trace each find back to its original post.\n- Known gaps: about 15 videos that @boneGPT quoted were deleted before capture, and two long re-upload threads weren't fully paged.\n\n|ID|Creator|Posted|Phase|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|20920